      ],
      "text": "1. Introduction",
      "font": "SegoeUI",
      "size": 32.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        187.64593505859375,
        214.00453186035156,
        212.44093322753906
      ],
      "text": "1.1. Background",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 19.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        217.8917999267578,
        527.3848266601562,
        232.3347930908203
      ],
      "text": "Children and young adolescents (aged below 15 years) represent about 11% of all people with TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        231.09193420410156,
        527.5413208007812,
        245.53492736816406
      ],
      "text": "globally. This means that close to 1.1 million children become ill with TB every year, almost half of them",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.9653959274292,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        244.2919464111328,
        527.4401245117188,
        258.7349548339844
      ],
      "text": "below five years of age. National TB programmes (NTPs) only notify less than half of these children,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        254.6978302001953,
        527.4116821289062,
        271.9348449707031
      ],
      "text": "(1) meaning that there is a large case detection gap  . The reasons for this gap include challenges with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        270.69183349609375,
        527.3217163085938,
        285.1348571777344
      ],
      "text": "specimen collection and bacteriological confirmation of TB in young children, due to the paucibacillary",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.960829734802246,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        281.0977783203125,
        527.4009399414062,
        298.3348083496094
      ],
      "text": "(10) nature of TB disease in this age group and the lack of highly sensitive point-of-care tests  . In 2020,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.996048927307129,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        297.0919189453125,
        527.236572265625,
        311.5349426269531
      ],
      "text": "the COVID-19 pandemic had an additional negative impact on TB notifications in children, with a 24%",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.974570274353027,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        310.29193115234375,
        527.3937377929688,
        324.7349548339844
      ],
      "text": "decrease in notifications compared to 2019 (in comparison, notifications in people aged 15 years",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        323.4917907714844,
        527.38037109375,
        337.934814453125
      ],
      "text": "and above decreased by 18%). In addition to the case detection gap, only one third of child contacts",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        333.8978271484375,
        524.4054565429688,
        351.13482666015625
      ],
      "text": "(1). below five years of age eligible for TB preventive treatment (TPT) actually received it in 2020",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        349.8918151855469,
        527.406982421875,
        364.3348388671875
      ],
      "text": "Young children are at higher risk of developing TB disease, including severe forms of TB, than older",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        363.091796875,
        527.4475708007812,
        377.5348205566406
      ],
      "text": "age groups, after TB infection, and the majority do so within a few months following exposure and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        373.497802734375,
        527.4470825195312,
        390.7348327636719
      ],
      "text": "(2, 3) infection  . In addition to children and young adolescents, over half a million older adolescents",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        386.69781494140625,
        332.7104797363281,
        403.934814453125
      ],
      "text": "(4) (15–19 years) are estimated to develop TB every year  .",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        408.40179443359375,
        527.4229125976562,
        425.6388244628906
      ],
      "text": "(5) The United Nations Sustainable Development Goal (SDGs)   and the World Health Organization",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        421.601806640625,
        527.4442138671875,
        438.8388366699219
      ],
      "text": "End TB Strategy (6) (WHO)   include targets to reduce TB incidence by 80% and TB deaths by 90%",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        437.5957946777344,
        527.3680419921875,
        452.038818359375
      ],
      "text": "to be achieved by the year 2030, relative to baseline levels in 2015. In addition, the Resolution",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        450.7958068847656,
        527.421142578125,
        465.23883056640625
      ],
      "text": "adopted by the United Nations General Assembly (UNGA) at the High-Level Meeting on the fight",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        463.9958190917969,
        527.4112548828125,
        478.4388427734375
      ],
      "text": "against tuberculosis in September 2018 commits to diagnosing and treating 40 million people with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        477.19580078125,
        527.3804321289062,
        491.6388244628906
      ],
      "text": "TB (including 3.5 million children), and 1.5 million people with DR-TB (including 115 000 children) by",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        490.39581298828125,
        527.3827514648438,
        504.8388366699219
      ],
      "text": "2022. It also commits to providing at least 30 million people (including 4 million child contacts under",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        503.5958251953125,
        527.4420166015625,
        518.038818359375
      ],
      "text": "five years of age), 20 million other household contacts (including children over the age of five years)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        514.0017700195312,
        422.24658203125,
        531.23876953125
      ],
      "text": "(7) and 6 million people living with HIV (including children) with TPT by 2022  .",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        538.4996948242188,
        527.4179077148438,
        552.9426879882812
      ],
      "text": "To support countries in preventing and managing TB in children and adolescents, WHO’s Global",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        548.9057006835938,
        527.5057983398438,
        566.1427001953125
      ],
      "text": "WHO Guidance for national tuberculosis programmes on  Tuberculosis Programme published the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        562.105712890625,
        527.4203491210938,
        579.3427124023438
      ],
      "text": "the management of tuberculosis in children (second edition)  in 2014. Since these guidelines were",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        578.0997314453125,
        527.4298706054688,
        592.542724609375
      ],
      "text": "published, new recommendations and guidance on the management of TB have been published",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        591.2996826171875,
        527.4223022460938,
        605.74267578125
      ],
      "text": "in WHO guidelines and other policy documents on TB prevention, screening, diagnosis, treatment,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        604.4996948242188,
        527.275390625,
        618.9426879882812
      ],
      "text": "management and models of care. Many of these recommendations are also applicable to children and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.961281776428223,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        617.69970703125,
        527.3848266601562,
        632.1427001953125
      ],
      "text": "adolescents. In addition, new evidence related to the management of TB in children and adolescents",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        630.8997192382812,
        527.4896240234375,
        645.3427124023438
      ],
      "text": "became available to WHO in 2021. Some of these data were received in response to a specific request",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.972665786743164,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        644.0997314453125,
        527.3839721679688,
        658.542724609375
      ],
      "text": "from WHO for data on the management of TB in children and adolescents, issued as an Expression",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        657.2996826171875,
        527.4398193359375,
        671.74267578125
      ],
      "text": "of Interest in July 2020,  which was developed in consultation with the core team of the Child and  17",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        670.4996948242188,
        527.3984375,
        684.9426879882812
      ],
      "text": "Adolescent TB Working group.  Data from a randomized controlled trial on treatment shortening  18",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        683.69970703125,
        527.380615234375,
        698.1427001953125
      ],
      "text": "for children with non-severe TB were made available to the WHO in 2021. Therefore, in 2021, the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        696.8997192382812,
        527.4675903320312,
        711.3427124023438
      ],
      "text": "WHO convened a Guideline Development Group (GDG) to review new evidence on the management",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.979931831359863,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        710.0997314453125,
        527.3958740234375,
        724.542724609375
      ],
      "text": "of TB in children and adolescents. This guideline update includes new recommendations that were",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        737.43701171875,
        524.4043579101562,
        751.1409912109375
      ],
      "text": "WHO public call for data on the management of TB in children and adolescents. 24 July 2020. WHO [website] (https://www.who.int/ 17",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        81.86609649658203,
        750.2369995117188,
        524.4002685546875,
        760.740966796875
      ],
      "text": "news-room/articles-detail/who-public-call-for-data-on-the-management-of-tb-in-children-and-adolescents, accessed 20 January 2022).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 7.9711480140686035,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        759.4718017578125,
        507.87005615234375,
        773.17578125
      ],
      "text": "Child and Adolescent TB Working Group (https://www.stoptb.org/wg/dots_expansion/childhoodtb/, accessed 20 January 2022).  18",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
